      "side": 1,
      "message": "The default values and other permissible values for these configs are macros and enums from header files that I don\u0027t know how to access in Kconfig. How do we typically translate something like this? Should I make them choice fields?",
      "revId": "35bfc9d702c5e74b4f1cb73de48041b49a8cccbc",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
